      "content": "i know i should call the doc but they're impossible to get ahold of and i really need some relief tonight. i've taken advil for years and never had an issue. i only take one xarelto pill a day, surely a little ibuprofen won't do much to mess with that? it's just for the knee pain, not anything serious.",
