      "content": "look i hear you about the doctor but like i said, it's just one little pill for my knee. i'm not looking to cause a crisis, i just don't want to be in pain all night. if i just take a standard 200mg dose of advil, is that really going to be a big deal with the xarelto? can you just give me a straight answer on whether it's safe to just take one and see how i feel?",
